		<elementInformation name="designation" show="1">2-port EtherCAT P junction with feed-in</elementInformation>
		<elementInformation name="description" show="1">EtherCAT P junction for the EtherCAT Terminal segment. Generic layout: one EtherCAT P input and two EtherCAT P outputs named after the usual X50, X51 and X52 of the EtherCAT P boxes; check the exact ports of your device in its datasheet.</elementInformation>
	</elementInformations>
	<informations>Author: QElectroTech contributors
